--- !u!114 &6648015514846587720
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1543802745513444186}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d9366127076758c4d9758f83d75a66b2, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  _textContent:
  - _loc: 0
    _content: "- Prend une douche, tu en a besoin.\nPuis il s\u2019\xE9loigna, laissant
      Luste seul avec le plateau. Ce dernier le ramassa, feignant l\u2019indiff\xE9rence.\nIl
      se recula dans l\u2019ombre de sa cellule et savoura son plateau repas avant
      d'ouvrir le savon emball\xE9 dans du papier toilette.\nLuste le trouva l\xE9g\xE8rement
      plus lourd que d'habitude, et l'observa avec plus d'attention.\nC'est alors
      qu'elle arriva \xE0 d\xE9cerner une cl\xE9 \xE0 l'int\xE9rieur."
  - _loc: 1
    _content: '-Take a shower, you need it.

      Then he moved away, leaving Luste
      alone with the tray. The latter picked it up, feigning indifference.

      He
      retreated into the shadow of his cell and savored his meal tray before opening
      the soap wrapped in toilet paper.

      Luste found it slightly heavier than
      usual, and watched it more attentively.

      It was then that she managed
      to give a key inside.'
  _textOverride: {fileID: 0}
