  m_text: "<b>Chapter-4 Finally the soap.</b>\n\nAfter almost finishing the decoration
    of his cell with pieces of clothing, Luste heard a guard approaching.\nIt was
    Leon, the guard in charge of distributing the meal for each cell.\nThis tour
    was also the distribution of soaps for each cell.\nL\xE9on gave the usual tray
    to Luste but this time by whispering a single sentence without lifting his eyes: "
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 2180264, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
  m_fontSharedMaterials: []
